l facts along seams.\n\nSubstantive visual construction: upper-right is unmistakably a worn cotton T-shirt with visible ribbed collar, sleeve junction, torso panel and lower hem, viewed obliquely from above. Cropping may trim a sleeve tip and outer surround but must preserve the collar-to-body-to-hem relation. The cream torso has exactly three broad unequal ink-dark horizontal bars in an unmistakable ordered arrangement, separated by unequal cream gaps, plus a small vermilion asymmetric reinforced patch at one hem corner. Its knit, hem and slightly worn softness look real. Lower-left are two substantial usable sewn cloth pouches, each with a clearly visible mouth/zipper opening, side seams and base; no miniature symbols. One pouch is visibly made from that chosen torso panel: SAME ordered three unequal dark bars, their unequal spacing, and SAME vermilion asymmetric reinforced corner now at the pouch base; bars truncate naturally at its new side seams. Make this correspondence clear through bounded cloth structure, beyond color alone. The second pouch is distinct plain muted vermilion/terracotta cotton, clearly a different completed pouch. Each pouch rests on its own broad open adult palm, with separate wrists entering from opposing left/bottom directions, offered toward one another to suggest sharing. Use simple legible hand support without interlaced fingers, tangled handoff, floating pouches or extra hands. Pouch fronts tilt less than the source garment so construction remains clear. The textile does not flow physically through the central title. No decorative arrows are needed.\n\nTypography: very legible contemporary Korean sans serif, broad bold clean Korean title as first anchor, medium English lead-in directly above, semibold activity directly below, regular-to-medium horizontal factual copy. Use well-formed proportional Hangul syllable blocks, open counters and exact word spaces; no stylized glyph distortions. At the 720-pixel-wide display equivalent the title is about 44px, activity 22px, English 19px, attendance 20px with 27px pitch, participation 19px with 28px pitch. Use strong near-black-on-cream contrast. Practical information must all be readable at 720×405, not tiny footnotes. One line per entry, including title and activity. Preserve punctuation visibly: the time has a clear medium-length en dash, colons, middle dots and comma. No extra copy, logos, watermarks, QR codes, pseudo-print, numbers, style names, microtext or words on the objects. Only the eleven entries below are printed, each exactly ONCE. Group labels below are placement instructions and are NOT printed.\n\nUpper-left attendance island, four lines:\n2027.01.16 토요일\n14:00–16:30\n성산 생활문화센터\n13:40부터 입장\n\nMiddle identity unit, top-to-bottom, with Korean title dominant:\nREMAKE & SHARE\n입던 옷의 다음 장면\n티셔츠를 파우치로 · 완성품 나눔\n\nLower-right participation/preparation island, four lines:\n참가비 3,000원 · 도구 제공\n사전 신청 · 정원 18명\n깨끗한 티셔츠 한 장 지참\n바느질이 처음이어도 괜찮아요\n\nProduce only this one complete independent poster; no comparison panels or contact sheet. Maintain the opposing-corner imagery, central linking title and two diagonal factual islands as one coherent composition. Finish cloth cutout edges, hand/object contacts, light consistency and clean type edges carefully.",
  "transparent_background": false
}

